    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -410,
      "width": 1390,
      "height": 245,
      "text": "# MDSE Knowledge Base — modeled dependencies\n\nEach line corresponds to a draft SysML v2 `dependency` in its owning use-case note. **Left:** stakeholder need, **center:** use case, **right:** logical function. The six earlier UC-00007 dependencies annotated `refines` are displayed as general dependencies pending semantic review. Model notes carry authority; this saved Canvas is a navigable projection, not an independent relationship store.\n\n**Twelve additional stakeholder needs are visible at the bottom of the first column as unconnected modeling gaps.**"
    },
