      "id": "unlinked-needs-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1990,
      "width": 530,
      "height": 290,
      "text": "## Open stakeholder-need modeling gaps\n\nThe 12 need notes below are present in MDSE, but none of the 16 current Knowledge Base use cases has a justified native dependency to them. They are shown **without invented edges**. Review each need and add a matching use case and function before modeling an implementation trace."
